---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'About — Noven';
const description =
  'Noven is a small UK business that helps service firms get found when their customers ask AI assistants who to use. Plain pricing, no guarantees we can’t keep, no invented results.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>What is Noven?</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Noven is a small business with one job: making sure that when your customers ask an AI
        assistant to recommend someone who does what you do, your name is in the answer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h2>Why does Noven exist?</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          Because a real shift is happening quietly. A meaningful share of people now ask ChatGPT,
          Google, Copilot or Perplexity for recommendations they would previously have researched
          themselves — and the businesses being recommended mostly have no idea why, while the
          businesses being left out have no idea it's happening.
        </p>
        <p>
          Most of what determines who gets recommended is unglamorous and fixable: whether the AI
          systems can read your website, whether the facts about your business agree with each
          other across the web, and whether anything you've published actually answers the
          questions customers ask. Almost no small firm has had this looked at. Noven exists to do
          exactly that, at prices a small firm can justify.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h2>How do we work?</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          <strong>Plainly.</strong> We write reports in ordinary English, we price in round
          numbers, and we tell you when you don't need us. Our audit exists partly so we can say
          "you're fine" and mean it.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Honestly about uncertainty.</strong> Nobody controls what an AI assistant says.
          We work on the inputs these systems demonstrably rely on and we measure the results,
          but we don't guarantee outcomes, and we don't show numbers that can't be checked.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>In the open.</strong> This website is built with the same methods we sell.
          Everything on it is readable by the AI crawlers, the facts are stated in
          machine-readable form, and the FAQ answers real questions. If the approach works,
          you'll be able to see it working on us.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h2>Who's behind it?</h2>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>
          Noven is run by Kieran Smith, from the Wirral. One person does the work — when you
          email Noven, you're emailing him, and the report you get back is one he wrote.
        </p>
        <p>
          [PLACEHOLDER: Kieran's background and relevant experience, and what led him to start
          Noven — two or three sentences. This is the part a cautious buyer reads hardest, so it
          needs to be specific and true. A photograph is optional but helps.]
        </p>
        <p>
          Noven works with clients across the UK, and the work is done remotely — there's nothing
          about it that needs us in the same room.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-tint">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Want to know where your business stands?</h2>
      <p>The £30 audit is the honest way to find out.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Book the £30 audit</a>
        <a href="/how-it-works/">Read how it works first</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
